  "notes": [
    "The commit policy is now each engineer's own choice, per clone, on their own",
    "machine. It lives in Git's private area",
    "(`$(git rev-parse --git-path gator-commit-policy.json)`), never in the",
    "repository, so one engineer can no longer relax the checks for everyone who",
    "pulls. Strict stays the default everywhere. The only local relaxation is",
    "Warn; there is no local Off.",
    "The hooks no longer read `enforcement_level` from the tracked",
